<title>USA: Granite Broadcast names GM at WEEK-TV.</title>
<headline>Granite Broadcast names GM at WEEK-TV.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Granite Broadcasting Corp said it named Mark DeSantis as president and general manager of WEEK-TV, the NBC affiliate in Peoria and Bloomington, Ill.</p>
<p>DeSantis was most recently president of his own promotion and marketing firm, and had been vice president of programming and marketing for KARE-TV in Minneapolis-St. Paul.</p>
<p>Granite operates 11 television stations that reach almost eight percent of the U.S. households.</p>
